#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD2259 expect=skipped domain=TS
#note "PLAN-function-surface-wave1 phase 3: the no-dictionary SKIP pin for the snomed type (K4-DICT, once per dictionary type). Row 2 pairs Headache's SNOMED concept ID with the term Nausea (violating-shaped) but #dictionaries is DELIBERATELY ABSENT, so the rule MUST report SKIPPED. Red under the phase-3 S3a/S3b sabotage by design."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col TSSEQ    type=Num
col TSPARMCD type=Char
col TSVAL    type=Char
col TSVALCD  type=Char
---
S01 | TS | 1 | INDIC  | Headache | 25064002
S01 | TS | 2 | INDIC  | Nausea   | 25064002
